<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 2-yr CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 2-yr CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of March 15, 1999 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ) and 2.0 trillion lire auction of a ninth tranche of 18-month July 15, 1998 CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Jul 15, 98  Pvs    Mar 15, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 6.57 pct    6.01   6.51 pct    6.03</p>
<p>Gross Yield     7.31	  6.74   7.35	  6.86</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.25	 91.65  87.00	 87.55</p>
<p>Bids	     3.50 trillion lire   3.73 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.0  trillion lire   2.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with previous auctions of CTZs on March 11.</p>
</text>
